<title>USA: Easton, Mass., won by Advest, Inc.</title>
<headline>Easton, Mass., won by Advest, Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advest, Inc said it won $3.205 million of Easton, Mass., municipal purpose loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.0271 percent.</p>
